  Segments:
  - Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ffa3583c671c5d3096a58193ed226d1e, type: 3}
    Subtitles:
    - Start: 0.14
      End: 9.1461
      Chinese: "多台机器人在无人操作时返回各自测试区的起点，引发关于自主意识的讨论。"
      English: "Reports of robots returning unprompted to the starting points in their test areas have renewed debate over possible self-awareness."
    - Start: 9.7067
      End: 12.7887
      Chinese: "部分样机此前曾跌离测试路线。"
      English: "Some had previously fallen from the test course."
    - Start: 13.3092
      End: 16.8315
      Chinese: "沿途监控却没有记录到返回过程。"
      English: "Cameras along the route recorded no return journey."
    - Start: 17.2319
      End: 20.5741
      Chinese: "厂方称，这或与内置返航系统有关。"
      English: "The company has cited a built-in homing system."
    Chinese: ""
    English: ""
    GapAfter: 0
